cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AssemblyTheoryTools, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "AssemblyTheoryTools"
abstract: >-
  AssemblyTheoryTools (ATT) is a Python toolkit for computing assembly
  indices and analyzing assembly pathways and assembly spaces for molecules,
  strings and graphs, for estimating molecular assembly index from infrared
  and tandem mass spectrometry data, and for computing ensemble quantities
  such as assembly and the exploration ratio from assembly indices and copy
  numbers.
